01:07:27,507 --> 01:07:29,217
UHH!

720
01:08:21,770 --> 01:08:24,856
PETER, WHERE
THE HELL ARE YOU?

721
01:08:27,067 --> 01:08:29,277
HELLO?

722
01:08:37,869 --> 01:08:41,998
YOU'VE REACHED THE VOICEMAIL
FOR SPECIAL AGENT PETER STRAHM.

723
01:08:42,040 --> 01:08:44,376
LEAVE A MESSAGE.

724
01:08:45,377 --> 01:08:48,588
MS. COWAN, I WANT
TO PUT A LOCATOR

725
01:08:48,630 --> 01:08:50,298
ON STRAHM'S MOBILE PHONE.

726
01:08:50,340 --> 01:08:52,342
RIGHT AWAY, SIR.

727
01:08:52,384 --> 01:08:54,469
CALL ME RIGHT BACK.

728
01:09:49,441 --> 01:09:51,067
THERE YOU ARE, STRAHM.

729
01:09:51,109 --> 01:09:53,987
ALL RIGHT.
I GOT HIM.

730
01:10:02,454 --> 01:10:03,997
WHAT THE HELL IS THAT?

731
01:10:04,039 --> 01:10:06,875
IT'S OUR NEXT NIGHTMARE.

732
01:10:11,838 --> 01:10:14,341
THERE ARE BLADES IN HERE.

733
01:10:18,345 --> 01:10:20,472
IT'S CONNECTED
TO THE DOOR.

734
01:10:20,513 --> 01:10:24,184
WHEN THE BEAKER
FILLS UP,
THE DOOR OPENS.

735
01:10:25,393 --> 01:10:28,021
FILLS WITH WHAT?

736
01:10:29,022 --> 01:10:30,482
BLOOD.

737
01:10:31,191 --> 01:10:32,984
OUR BLOOD.

738
01:10:33,026 --> 01:10:35,737
I THINK AN ARM
IS SUPPOSED TO GO

739
01:10:35,779 --> 01:10:37,948
IN THERE
TO FILL THE BEAKER.

740
01:10:37,989 --> 01:10:42,035
WAIT. WHY CAN'T
WE JUST USE THE WATER
FROM THE OTHER ROOM?

741
01:10:42,077 --> 01:10:43,244
NO, THE SLOTS
ARE CLOSED.

742
01:10:43,286 --> 01:10:45,455
WE HAVE TO STICK OUR ARM
IN TO KEEP THEM OPEN,

743
01:10:45,497 --> 01:10:46,498
BUT THEN THEY GET STUCK.

744
01:10:46,539 --> 01:10:49,876
WE NEED TO CLOSE
THAT DOOR.

745
01:10:49,918 --> 01:10:51,920
SO WHAT?

746
01:10:51,962 --> 01:10:53,797
WE FIGHT TO THE DEATH
AND THE, UH...

747
01:10:53,838 --> 01:10:57,801
THE WINNER GETS TO FEED THEM
WITH THE OTHER PERSON'S BLOOD?

748
01:11:02,514 --> 01:11:04,474
WAIT, WAIT, WAIT,
WAIT, WAIT, WAIT.

749
01:11:04,516 --> 01:11:06,935
DO YOU STILL
HAVE THE KEYS FROM
THAT FIRST ROOM?

750
01:11:06,977 --> 01:11:07,811
YEAH.

751
01:11:07,852 --> 01:11:09,354
TRY ONE OF THEM
ON THAT DOOR.

752
01:11:09,396 --> 01:11:10,563
IT WON'T WORK.

753
01:11:10,605 --> 01:11:13,024
NO, NO, NO, IT MIGHT.
THIS ONE HAS A KEY HOLE.

754
01:11:16,987 --> 01:11:20,448
IT--IT'S NOT EVEN
THE SAME LOCK.

755
01:11:22,200 --> 01:11:25,453
WHY ARE THERE 5 SLOTS
ON THIS MACHINE?

756
01:11:25,495 --> 01:11:28,415
SHOULDN'T
THERE ONLY BE ONE?

757
01:11:34,546 --> 01:11:37,424
THEY ALL WOULD
HAVE WORKED.

758
01:11:38,049 --> 01:11:38,883
WHERE ARE YOU GOING?

759
01:11:38,925 --> 01:11:40,885
HURRY BEFORE
THE BOMBS GO OFF.

760
01:11:44,389 --> 01:11:47,475
I DON'T THINK
THIS IS A GOOD IDEA.

761
01:11:47,517 --> 01:11:50,186
THE TUB WASN'T
MEANT FOR ONE PERSON.

762
01:11:50,228 --> 01:11:52,313
WE WERE SUPPOSED
TO HOLD ONE CABLE EACH

763
01:11:52,355 --> 01:11:54,858
AND SUFFER A SMALL SHOCK.

764
01:11:55,316 --> 01:11:56,693
IT WAS MEANT FOR 5 PEOPLE.

765
01:11:56,735 --> 01:11:58,319
THEY ALL WERE,
EVERY GAME.

766
01:11:58,361 --> 01:12:01,406
WE ONLY NEEDED ONE KEY
IN THE FIRST ROOM.

767
01:12:01,448 --> 01:12:03,158
THEY ALL WORKED
AND ANY ONE OF THEM

768
01:12:03,199 --> 01:12:05,076
WOULD HAVE OPENED
EVERY COLLAR.

769
01:12:05,118 --> 01:12:07,537
IN THE SECOND ROOM,
THE 3 TUBES

770
01:12:07,579 --> 01:12:09,289
WERE LARGE ENOUGH
FOR MORE THAN ONE PERSON.

771
01:12:09,330 --> 01:12:13,585
WE WERE SUPPOSED TO WORK
TOGETHER SO WE ALL SURVIVED.

772
01:12:13,626 --> 01:12:15,336
THAT'S THE GAME.

773
01:12:15,378 --> 01:12:16,713
YOUR LIFE-LONG
INSTINCTS WILL LEAD YOU

774
01:12:16,755 --> 01:12:19,466
TO ONE THING,
BUT I IMPLORE YOU
TO DO THE OPPOSITE.

775
01:12:19,507 --> 01:12:20,675
OH, GOD.

776
01:12:20,717 --> 01:12:21,634
WHOOPS.

777
01:12:21,676 --> 01:12:24,471
YEAH, BIG FUCKING WHOOPS.

778
01:12:30,727 --> 01:12:31,603
AAH!

779
01:12:39,486 --> 01:12:41,154
HELLO AND WELCOME.

780
01:12:41,196 --> 01:12:43,531
THIS JOURNEY HAS BEEN ONE
OF DISCOVERY AND HOPEFULLY

781
01:12:43,573 --> 01:12:46,493
YOU'VE DISCOVERED
THE WHOLE IS GREATER

782
01:12:46,534 --> 01:12:48,369
THAN THE SOME OF ITS PARTS.

783
01:12:48,411 --> 01:12:49,871
THE HUMAN BODY,
FOR INSTANCE,

784
01:12:49,913 --> 01:12:52,165
IS AN ASTOUNDINGLY
DURABLE CREATION.

785
01:12:52,207 --> 01:12:55,502
IT CONTAINS APPROXIMATELY
10 PINTS OF BLOOD,

786
01:12:55,543 --> 01:12:58,004
YET IT IS STILL
ABLE TO OPERATE

787
01:12:58,046 --> 01:12:59,547
WITH JUST HALF OF THAT.

788
01:12:59,589 --> 01:13:02,926
THE DEVICE BEFORE
YOU IS ONE OF SACRIFICE,

789
01:13:02,967 --> 01:13:04,219
A SACRIFICE OF BLOOD.

790
01:13:04,260 --> 01:13:05,428
IN ORDER TO OPEN THE DOOR,

791
01:13:05,470 --> 01:13:08,848
THE BEAKER MUST BE FILLED
TO THE MARKED LEVEL,

792
01:13:08,890 --> 01:13:11,768
A LEVEL THAT IS
OF NO COINCIDENCE.

793
01:13:11,810 --> 01:13:15,396
THIS AMOUNT CAN COME
FROM ANY ONE OF YOU.

794
01:13:15,438 --> 01:13:16,648
THAT DOES NOT MATTER.

795
01:13:16,689 --> 01:13:18,316
WHAT DOES MATTER IS TIME.

796
01:13:18,358 --> 01:13:21,361
FOR IN 15 MINUTES, IF
THE BEAKER IS NOT FILLED,

797
01:13:21,402 --> 01:13:22,654
THE BOMBS WILL EXPLODE,

798
01:13:22,695 --> 01:13:26,324
AND THE DOORS WILL
BE SEALED FOREVER.

799
01:13:26,366 --> 01:13:27,617
SO, NOW I ASK YOU,

800
01:13:27,659 --> 01:13:31,538
HOW MUCH BLOOD WILL YOU
GIVE IN ORDER TO SURVIVE?

801
01:13:36,918 --> 01:13:38,169
FUCK!

802
01:13:38,211 --> 01:13:39,337
FUCK!

803
01:13:39,379 --> 01:13:42,590
ALL RIGHT, SO ONE PERSON
CAN FILL THE BEAKER

804
01:13:42,632 --> 01:13:44,717
WITH 10 PINTS
OF BLOOD AND DIE,

805
01:13:44,759 --> 01:13:48,680
OR 2 PEOPLE
CAN FILL IT WITH 5 PINTS

806
01:13:48,721 --> 01:13:51,933
AND MAYBE LIVE.

807
01:13:51,975 --> 01:13:54,769
WHAT ARE WE GOING TO DO?

808
01:15:26,653 --> 01:15:28,363
I LIED.

809
01:15:28,404 --> 01:15:31,366
I KNOW THE INVESTIGATIVE
JOURNALIST IN THERE IS--

810
01:15:31,407 --> 01:15:32,450
HIS NAME IS CHARLES,

811
01:15:32,492 --> 01:15:35,495
HE WAS WRITING A STORY
ABOUT WHAT I DID.

812
01:15:35,536 --> 01:15:38,289
WHAT DID YOU DO?

813
01:15:39,082 --> 01:15:42,877
A DEALER GAVE ME
AN OUNCE OF HEROIN

814
01:15:42,919 --> 01:15:46,297
TO BURN DOWN AN ABANDONED
BUILDING, BUT IT--

815
01:15:46,339 --> 01:15:49,050
OH, GOD,
IT WASN'T ABANDONED.

816
01:15:49,092 --> 01:15:50,593
THERE WAS
8 PEOPLE IN THERE.

817
01:15:50,635 --> 01:15:52,762
8 PEOPLE DIED.

818
01:15:52,804 --> 01:15:58,059
AND--AND THE FEDS GOT
INVOLVED AND I GOT CAUGHT,

819
01:15:58,101 --> 01:15:59,978
BUT I MADE A DEAL
AND MY DAD GOT ME OFF,

820
01:16:00,019 --> 01:16:01,771
BUT THE GUY WHO HIRED
ME DISAPPEARED.

821
01:16:01,813 --> 01:16:04,565
AND NOTHING HAPPENED,
NOTHING HAPPENED.

822
01:16:20,665 --> 01:16:21,499
FIRE.

823
01:16:21,541 --> 01:16:22,875
IT'S WHAT CONNECTS US.

824
01:16:22,917 --> 01:16:26,838
THE FIRE INSPECTOR WHO WROTE
THE BOGUS ACCIDENT REPORT,

825
01:16:26,879 --> 01:16:30,967
THE CITY PLANNER
WHO PUSHED THROUGH
THE RESIDENTIAL PERMITS,

826
01:16:31,009 --> 01:16:35,263
THE JOURNALIST THAT BURIED
THE INVESTIGATIVE STORY,

827
01:16:35,305 --> 01:16:38,850
THE RICH KID JUNKIE
WHO WAS THE PATSY

828
01:16:38,891 --> 01:16:40,268
AND THE REAL ESTATE
DEVELOPER

829
01:16:40,310 --> 01:16:41,728
WHO SET
IT ALL IN MOTION.

830
01:16:41,769 --> 01:16:46,816
WE KILLED 8 PEOPLE
AND STOLE A PROPERTY
AND NOBODY CARED.

831
01:16:46,858 --> 01:16:48,609
WHY--WHY DID THEY ALL DO IT?

832
01:16:48,651 --> 01:16:49,777
WAS IT FOR MONEY?

833
01:16:49,819 --> 01:16:51,029
THIS WAS YOUR PLAN?

834
01:16:51,070 --> 01:16:52,864
THERE WAS 8 PEOPLE STILL
LIVING IN THAT BUILDING.

835
01:16:52,905 --> 01:16:53,698
YOU HAD TO KNOW THAT.

836
01:16:53,740 --> 01:16:56,159
DID YOU KNOW THAT?

837
01:17:04,542 --> 01:17:05,835
I CAN'T DO THIS ALONE.

838
01:17:05,877 --> 01:17:08,129
LOOK AT ME, I CAN'T DO THIS
ALONE, I CAN'T, I CAN'T.

839
01:17:08,171 --> 01:17:09,797
OK, OK.

840
01:17:33,905 --> 01:17:36,824
WE HAVE TO GO ON 3.

841
01:17:53,966 --> 01:17:55,676
ONE...

842
01:18:02,809 --> 01:18:04,852
2!

843
01:18:08,314 --> 01:18:11,567
WE'RE DEAD IN THE HOLE!

844
01:18:21,369 --> 01:18:22,495
3!

845
01:18:29,919 --> 01:18:31,879
GOD!

846
01:19:35,359 --> 01:19:37,111
UH!

847
01:19:48,998 --> 01:19:50,541
HELLO, AGENT STRAHM.

848
01:19:50,583 --> 01:19:52,001
IF YOU ARE HEARING THIS,

849
01:19:52,043 --> 01:19:56,047
THEN YOU HAVE ONCE AGAIN FOUND
WHAT YOU ARE LOOKING FOR...

850
01:19:56,088 --> 01:19:57,590
OR SO YOU THINK.

851
01:19:57,632 --> 01:20:00,259
YOUR DEDICATION
IS TO BE COMMENDED,

852
01:20:00,301 --> 01:20:01,928
BUT I ASK YOU,
IF YOU'VE LEARNED

853
01:20:01,969 --> 01:20:05,139
ANYTHING ON YOUR JOURNEY
OF DISCOVERY?

854
01:20:05,181 --> 01:20:07,183
AS THE OLD ADAGE GOES,

855
01:20:07,225 --> 01:20:09,602
FOOL ME ONCE, SHAME ON YOU,

856
01:20:09,644 --> 01:20:12,813
FOOL ME TWICE, SHAME ON ME.

857
01:20:12,855 --> 01:20:17,693
THE SITUATION YOU FIND
YOURSELF IN IS ONE OF TRUST.

858
01:20:17,735 --> 01:20:20,238
SO, I ASK YOU,
SPECIAL AGENT STRAHM,

859
01:20:20,279 --> 01:20:22,281
HAVE YOU LEARNED TO TRUST ME?

860
01:20:22,323 --> 01:20:23,866
THE ONLY WAY
TO SURVIVE THIS ROOM

861
01:20:23,908 --> 01:20:26,702
IS BY ENTERING
THE GLASS BOX BEFORE YOU.

862
01:20:26,744 --> 01:20:33,584
PAIN WILL BE INCURRED, BUT
YOU HAVE A CHANCE OF SURVIVAL.

863
01:20:49,058 --> 01:20:50,142
WE DID IT.

864
01:20:50,184 --> 01:20:51,352
WE WON.

865
01:20:51,394 --> 01:20:53,104
WE WON.

866
01:22:39,502 --> 01:22:43,714
I GOT YOU,
YOU MOTHERFUCKER.

867
01:22:47,134 --> 01:22:49,303
Woman: UHH!

868
01:23:04,527 --> 01:23:06,112
DROP IT!

869
01:23:06,153 --> 01:23:08,072
I SAID DROP IT!

870
01:23:14,245 --> 01:23:16,247
WHO DID THIS TO YOU?

871
01:23:16,288 --> 01:23:19,041
WHO DID THIS TO YOU?

872
01:23:19,083 --> 01:23:21,794
AHH. WE WON.

873
01:23:21,836 --> 01:23:23,838
WE WON.

874
01:23:23,879 --> 01:23:26,298
WE WORKED TOGETHER.

875
01:23:26,340 --> 01:23:27,842
WE DID IT.

876
01:23:36,142 --> 01:23:38,227
I NEED IMMEDIATE
MEDICAL ASSISTANCE.

877
01:23:38,269 --> 01:23:41,981
1293 SANDBURG DRIVE.

878
01:23:44,066 --> 01:23:45,484
AH!

879
01:23:50,948 --> 01:23:52,658
AAH!

880
01:24:21,187 --> 01:24:24,023
JESUS, PETER.

881
01:24:32,782 --> 01:24:35,034
AAH!

882
01:24:37,369 --> 01:24:39,246
TELL ME HOW TO OPEN IT!

883
01:24:39,288 --> 01:24:42,249
TELL ME HOW TO OPEN IT!

884
01:24:53,135 --> 01:24:55,846
HOWEVER, IF YOU
CHOOSE NOT TO,

885
01:24:55,888 --> 01:24:57,807
YOU WILL NEVER
BE HEARD FROM AGAIN.

886
01:24:57,848 --> 01:24:59,975
YOUR BODY
WILL NEVER BE FOUND.

887
01:25:00,017 --> 01:25:01,769
YOU WILL SIMPLY VANISH.

888
01:25:01,811 --> 01:25:05,606
I ASK YOU,
SPECIAL AGENT STRAHM,

889
01:25:05,648 --> 01:25:08,776
HAVE YOU LEARNED
ENOUGH TO TRUST ME?

890
01:25:08,818 --> 01:25:10,611
WILL YOU HEED MY WARNING?

891
01:25:10,653 --> 01:25:12,112
FOR, IF YOU DO NOT--

892
01:25:12,154 --> 01:25:13,072
FUCK YOU.

893
01:25:13,113 --> 01:25:15,074
THIS ROOM WILL
FOREVER BE YOUR TOMB

894
01:25:15,115 --> 01:25:17,910
AND MY LEGACY
WILL BECOME YOURS.

895
01:25:17,952 --> 01:25:21,497
IF YOU'RE GOOD
AT ANTICIPATING
THE HUMAN MIND.

896
01:25:21,539 --> 01:25:23,165
I THINK I'M
BEING FOLLOWED.

897
01:25:23,207 --> 01:25:24,291
WHO WOULD BE FOLLOWING YOU?

898
01:25:24,333 --> 01:25:26,585
I WANT TO TALK TO JILL
TUCK ONE LAST TIME.

899
01:25:26,627 --> 01:25:30,089
HE SUSPECTED SOMEONE
ON THE INSIDE.

900
01:25:31,257 --> 01:25:34,718
IT LEAVES
NOTHING TO CHANCE.

901
01:25:37,721 --> 01:25:39,306
WE WERE ALL SUPPOSED TO DIE.

902
01:25:40,307 --> 01:25:42,810
YOU WERE SUPPOSED
TO BE THE HERO.

903
01:25:45,604 --> 01:25:48,190
MAKE YOUR CHOICE.

904
01:25:51,610 --> 01:25:54,613
COWAN, GET THIS
TO ERICKSON,

905
01:25:54,655 --> 01:25:57,366
I WANT TO YOU
TO PUT OUT AN A.P.B.

906
01:25:57,408 --> 01:26:00,619
SUSPECT'S NAME
IS PETER STRAHM.

907
01:26:00,661 --> 01:26:02,580
YEAH, THAT'S RIGHT.

908
01:26:02,621 --> 01:26:05,499
SPECIAL AGENT
PETER STRAHM.

909
01:26:26,937 --> 01:26:30,941
TELL ME HOW TO STOP IT,
YOU SON OF A BITCH.

910
01:26:33,444 --> 01:26:35,404
I KNOW WHO YOU ARE!

911
01:26:35,446 --> 01:26:36,947
I KNOW!

912
01:27:21,617 --> 01:27:25,579
CAPTIONING MADE POSSIBLE BY
LIONS GATE ENTERTAINMENT

